Subject: [PATCH] tests: separate offline azsecrets tests from the live proxy
 harness

Move the existing challenge validation, ID and empty-name tests together
with their fake credential into an offline test file. Gate the remaining
Key Vault service tests and recording-proxy TestMain behind azure_live.
The original assertions are preserved and the live tests remain available
with that tag and the upstream test dependencies/services.

Signed-off-by: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
